 class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> passive <highlight>be delivered</highlight> <ref ref=\"Ps 22:6\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(19,22,6)\">Ps 22:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 11:21\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(20,11,21)\">Prov 11:21</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 28:26\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(20,28,26)\">Prov 28:26</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 22:30\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(18,22,30)\">Job 22:30</ref>; <ref ref=\"Dan 12:1\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(27,12,1)\">Dan 12:1</ref> (later usage). <b>Pi`el</b> <highlight>Perfect</highlight> 3 masculine singular <bdbheb>מִלֵּט</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 33:5\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(26,33,5)\">Ezek 33:5</ref> <bdbheb>וּמִלַּטֿ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Eccl 9:15\" b=\"21\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(21,9,15)\">Eccl 9:15</ref> suffix <bdbheb>מִלְּטֵ֫נוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Sam 19:10\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(10,19,10)\">2Sam 19:10</ref> <highlight>Imperfect</highlight> <bdbheb>יְמַלֵּט</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Amos 2:14\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(30,2,14)\">Amos 2:14</ref> + 8 t., suffix <bdbheb>יְמַלְּטֵ֫הוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 41:2\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"41\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"41\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(19,41,2)\">Ps 41:2</ref> + 5 t. Imperfect; <highlight>Imperative</highlight> <bdbheb>מַלְּטָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 116:4\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"116\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"116\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(19,116,4)\">Ps 116:4</ref> feminine <bdbheb>מַלְּטִי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Kgs 1:12\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(11,1,12)\">1Kgs 1:12</ref> + 4 t. Imperative; <highlight>Infinitive absolute</highlight> <bdbheb>מַלֵּט</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 46:2\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"46\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"46\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(23,46,2)\">Isa 46:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 39:18\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"39\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"39\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(24,39,18)\">Jer 39:18</ref> <highlight>Participle</highlight> <bdbheb>מְמַלֵּט</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Sam 19:11\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(9,19,11)\">1Sam 19:11</ref> plural <bdbheb>מְמַלְּטִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Sam 19:6\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(10,19,6)\">2Sam 19:6</ref> — </div><div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlight>lay</highlight> (eggs; i.e. let them slip out; of arrow-snake) <ref ref=\"Isa 34:15\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(23,34,15)\">Isa 34:15</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> <highlight>let escape:</highlight> <bdbheb>וימלטו עצמתיו</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Kgs 23:18\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(12,23,18)\">2Kgs 23:18</ref> <highlight>and so they let his bones</highlight> (the prophet's) <highlight>escape</highlight> (from the burning). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> <highlight>deliver</highlight>, absolute <ref ref=\"Isa 46:4\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"46\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"46\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(23,46,4)\">Isa 46:4</ref> with accusative <ref ref=\"Isa 46:2\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"46\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"46\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(23,46,2)\">Isa 46:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 39:18\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"39\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"39\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(24,39,18)\">Jer 39:18</ref> (twice in verse); <ref ref=\"Ps 41:2\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"41\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"41\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(19,41,2)\">Ps 41:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 22:30\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(18,22,30)\">Job 22:30</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 29:12\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"12\" cE